description:
Objective: the CQ-RF epic's one final integration-and-hardening task. It owns the epic's full regression, its docs sweep and an adversarial review of the whole epic diff.

Created by architect-e4b7eee0 on 2026-10-30. It depends on CQ-RF01..RF06.

Deliverable:
- Full regression, with counts:
  - the daemon's vitest suite;
  - JetBrains `./gradlew test`, through cmd.exe on this WSL host;
  - VS Code `npm test` and `npm run compile`;
  - bash scripts/tests/postflight.sh;
  - root `npm run lint`.
- Docs sweep:
  - docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md describe the persistent provenance and downgrade-pin state, the daemon replacement flow and the Windows restart behavior, and link the CQ-RF05 decision;
  - docs/CONFIGURATION.md lists any new state locations.
- An adversarial pass over the whole CQ-RF diff, looking for any way to reach a repository-supplied runtime, or a silent downgrade, under the protected profile.

Out of scope:
- new behavior beyond fixes the review finds;
- enabling verified-local;
- .moe edits.

Verification commands (fresh, each exit 0): cd packages/moe-daemon && npm test; cmd.exe /d /c "cd /d D:\projexts\moes\moe-jetbrains && .\gradlew.bat test --rerun"; cd moe-vscode && npm test && npm run compile; bash scripts/tests/postflight.sh; npm run lint.
